; Stage 15 W9 item 13, the position it was filed at: an unrecognized list head
; in a type position. `parse-type-from-node` matched no shape and fell off the
; end of its NODE-CELL arm returning null, and `defstruct` reads that null as
; "no :type was written" — so the diagnostic blamed the missing annotation
; instead of naming `nosuch`.
;
; Compiling this must FAIL with:
;   "unknown type: nosuch — not defined anywhere in this compilation unit"
; and specifically NOT with "defstruct: field 'xs' missing :type".
(defstruct S (xs (nosuch i32)))

(defn main ():i32
  (return 0))
